{"type":"message","id":"0a1510f4","parentId":"74be4c98","timestamp":"2026-04-02T15:58:30.057Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-04-02 15:58 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Create a complete interactive React/Next.js project for EchoNexus protocol demonstration. The project should be created at /home/node/.openclaw/outputs/main/echonexus-dapp\n\n## Project Requirements\n\n### Core Features to Implement\n1. **Asset Creation Flow** - Create Skill assets linked to ECHO NFTs\n2. **Skill Marketplace** - Browse and search available Skills\n3. **Skill Execution Panel** - Simulate executing a Skill with billing\n4. **Permission Arbiter** - Interactive permission decision tree demo\n5. **Derivative Creator** - Fork/create derivative Skills\n6. **Revenue Dashboard** - View revenue distribution\n7. **Four Rights Visualizer** - Ownership/Usage/Derivative/Extension\n\n### Tech Stack\n- Next.js 14 (App Router)\n- TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS\n- shadcn/ui components\n- React Context for state management\n- Mock data for blockchain simulation\n\n### Project Structure\n```\nechonexus-dapp/\n├── app/\n│   ├── layout.tsx\n│   ├── page.tsx (landing)\n│   ├── marketplace/\n│   │   └── page.tsx\n│   ├── create/\n│   │   └── page.tsx\n│   ├── skill/[id]/\n│   │   └── page.tsx\n│   ├── dashboard/\n│   │   └── page.tsx\n│   └── arbiter/\n│       └── page.tsx\n├── components/\n│   ├── ui/ (shadcn)\n│   ├── layout/\n│   │   ├── Header.tsx\n│   │   └── Sidebar.tsx\n│   ├── home/\n│   │   ├── Hero.tsx\n│   │   ├── Features.tsx\n│   │   └── ArchitectureDiagram.tsx\n│   ├── marketplace/\n│   │   ├── SkillCard.tsx\n│   │   ├── SearchFilters.tsx\n│   │   └── SkillDetail.tsx\n│   ├── create/\n│   │   ├── AssetCreator.tsx\n│   │   └── ManifestBuilder.tsx\n│   ├── execution/\n│   │   ├── ExecutionPanel.tsx\n│   │   └── BillingSimulator.tsx\n│   ├── arbiter/\n│   │   ├── DecisionTree.tsx\n│   │   └── PermissionChecker.tsx\n│   ├── derivative/\n│   │   └── DerivativeCreator.tsx\n│   └── dashboard/\n│       ├── RevenueChart.tsx\n│       └── RightsManager.tsx\n├── lib/\n│   ├── mock-data.ts\n│   ├── echonexus.ts (core types/interfaces)\n│   └── utils.ts\n├── contexts/\n│   └── EchoNexusContext.tsx\n└── package.json\n```\n\n### Key Interfaces (lib/echonexus.ts)\n```typescript\ninterface EchoAsset {\n  echoAssetId: string;\n  owner: string;\n  skillManifest: SkillManifest;\n  pricing: PricingModel;\n  permissions: PermissionState;\n}\n\ninterface SkillManifest {\n  skillId: string;\n  name: string;\n  description: string;\n  version: string;\n  capabilities: string[];\n  parameters: ParameterSchema[];\n}\n\ninterface PricingModel {\n  type: 'TimesBased' | 'DurationBased' | 'Subscription' | 'Freemium' | 'Hybrid';\n  pricePerUse?: number;\n  pricePerMinute?: number;\n  subscriptionFee?: number;\n}\n\ninterface ArbiterDecision {\n  requestId: string;\n  requestedCapability: string;\n  requester: string;\n  rightsCheck: RightsCheckResult;\n  verdict: 'APPROVED' | 'DENIED' | 'CONDITIONAL' | 'ESCALATE';\n  conditions?: string[];\n  settlementPlan: SettlementPlan;\n}\n```\n\n### Important Implementation Notes\n1. Use dark theme with cyan/purple accent colors (#00d4ff, #a855f7)\n2. All blockchain interactions should be mocked with realistic delays and state\n3. Include interactive forms with validation\n4. Show transaction hashes, gas estimates\n5. Include animated transitions between states\n6. Make it fully responsive\n7. Include realistic sample data for Skills and assets\n\nPlease create ALL the files with complete, working code. The project should be runnable with `npm install && npm run dev`."}],"timestamp":1775145510040}}
